    "data_confidence_summary": "V6.1 separates official O-tier, public-observation P-tier, derived D-tier, and concept C-tier evidence. A 2021 ESA WorldCover signal is aggregated into 1,248 clipped 100m supporting cells and corrects the concept partition, but is not current-condition certification. Required design GeoJSON remains provisional. Dazhongsi transport figures are a scoped project stress case. CWS-01 is an offline deterministic rule contract with named human takeover and no automatic action; it is not field deployment, consent, safety certification, or operating approval. Agent prompts, concise traces, tool versions, hashes, human decisions, responsibility gates, and stop rules are persisted; implementation approval, representative consent, official geometry, and professional cost are not claimed.",
